    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming two bedroom on circa 1.75 acres in Kylemore Village, Renvyle, Connemara, Co. Galway.\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart opf breathtaking Connemara countryside, this beautifully presented two bedroom cottage offers a rare opportunity to acquire a rare opportunity to acquire a truly charming rural retreat on a private site of circa 1.75 acres.\r\n\r\nLovingly maintained and presented in excellent condition throughout, the property seamlessly combines rustic character with comfortable modern living. The spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home, featuring a striking stone fireplace with an oil fired stove, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nA delightful gable sunroom enjoys tranquil views over the mature gardens and the picturesque stream that gently flows along the boundary, providing a peaceful setting to relax and enjoy the surrounding natural beauty.  There is also a utility room and a small water closet.\r\n\r\nThe extensive grounds offer exceptional privacy, with mature planting and ample outdoor space to appreciate the stunning Connemara landscape. Two substantial outbuildings provide excellent storage and workshop potential, making the property equally suited to hobbyists, craftspeople or those requiring additional workspace.\r\n\r\nIdeally located between the vibrant towns of Clifden and Westport, the property enjoys the best of both worlds—peaceful countryside living with convenient access to a wealth of amenities, restaurants, shops and outdoor pursuits. The world-renowned Kylemore Abbey is just a short drive away, while the spectacular scenery of Connemara National Park and the Wild Atlantic Way are right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThis is an exceptional opportunity to acquire a character-filled home in one of Ireland's most sought-after and scenic locations, whether as a permanent residence, holiday home or investment property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming two bedroom on circa 1.75 acres in Kylemore Village, Renvyle, Connemara, Co. Galway.\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart opf breathtaking Connemara countryside, this beautifully presented three bedroomn cottage offers a rare opportunity to acquire a rare opportunity to acquire a truly charming rural retreat on a private site of circa 1.75 acres.\r\n\r\nLovingly maintained and presented in excellent condition throughout, the property seamlessly combines rustic character with comfortable modern living. The spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home, featuring a striking stone fireplace with a solid fuel stove, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nA delightful gable sunroom enjoys tranquil views over the mature gardens and the picturesque stream that gently flows along the boundary, providing a peaceful setting to relax and enjoy the surrounding natural beauty.  There is also a utility room and a small water closet.\r\n\r\nThe extensive grounds offer exceptional privacy, with mature planting and ample outdoor space to appreciate the stunning Connemara landscape. Two substantial outbuildings provide excellent storage and workshop potential, making the property equally suited to hobbyists, craftspeople or those requiring additional workspace.\r\n\r\nIdeally located between the vibrant towns of Clifden and Westport, the property enjoys the best of both worlds—peaceful countryside living with convenient access to a wealth of amenities, restaurants, shops and outdoor pursuits. The world-renowned Kylemore Abbey is just a short drive away, while the spectacular scenery of Connemara National Park and the Wild Atlantic Way are right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThis is an exceptional opportunity to acquire a character-filled home in one of Ireland's most sought-after and scenic locations, whether as a permanent residence, holiday home or investment property."
      },
